      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "file header comment",
      "prov:value": "cat-harness's shared steps: BPMN 2.0 global tasks, each one step that two or more of this layer's processes perform with the same Skill, in a lane naming the same Role, for the same purpose (spec §7 of the lane / role / skill model). This file holds NO process, on purpose (owner, 2026-10-20, \"a1\"): a step is defined here once and each process calls it with a callActivity whose calledElement is the global task's bare id (b1).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
