      "prov:value": "The stores this layer's processes read and write (owner, 2026-11-01, Q-BR-3 A and Q-DS-3 A). A store is not a lane: a process draws a dataStoreReference whose dataStoreRef is one of these ids, and the tasks that read or write it say so with data associations.",
